  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.3.12 - SentencePiece honours the GGUF tokenizer.ggml.add_space_prefix flag (Gemma 2/3 multi-turn chat fixed: no stray space token at turn boundaries). v5.3.11 -Image and text to 3D (TRELLIS.2: photo or prompt -> PBR GLB) on CUDA (tensor cores), OpenCL, CPU and in the browser on WebGPU (portable tiled GEMM + flash attention, device mesh clustering, checkpoint streaming / per-file OPFS caching, background pipeline builds). Face detection and recognition (YuNet + SFace, matched against OpenCV). Requires SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.3.8. See CHANGELOG.md.",
